<!-- QR glyph: three finder patterns and a scatter of data modules.

     Drawn rather than imported so it reads at 24dp on a home screen, where an
     icon competes with wallpaper and every other launcher icon. The three
     corner squares are the part people recognise as "QR" at a glance. -->
